{
  "$description": "Cobalt Five restyles caskade.default (#125). It turns the HUD off (grid, scanlines, chamfers and frame corners) and leaves alone the tokens Appearance and console mode change. Text colours meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) on every surface, and white on the accent does too (5.4:1).",
